# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WiFi Billing — never commit any of this
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# SECRETS. config.json holds your M-Pesa Consumer Key/Secret/Passkey, your router
# API password and your admin password. Committing it would hand anyone who can
# read the repo the ability to raise payments against your Till.
config.json
config.local.json
*.json.tmp
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# RUNTIME DATA. The SQLite database contains your customers' phone numbers,
# every M-Pesa receipt and your revenue record.
data/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.db

# GENERATED OUTPUT. Voucher PDFs contain unused, redeemable access codes —
# publishing them would give away your product for free.
output/
service.log
*.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
